This is a complete, self-contained HTML file for a pixel-perfect Space Invaders game inspired by the 1978 Taito arcade. It includes the classic sprite design, rules, and sound effects.
```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Space Invaders – 1978 Taito</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body {
            background: #000;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
        }
        .game-wrapper {
            background: #111;
            padding: 20px;
            border: 4px solid #333;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px #0f0f0f;
        }
        canvas {
            display: block;
            background: #0a0a0a;
            image-rendering: pixelated;
            image-rendering: crisp-edges;
            width: 800px;
            height: 800px;
            border: 2px solid #2a2a2a;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px #0000aa;
        }
        .controls {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 0;
            background: #0d0d0d;
            border-top: 2px solid #2a2a2a;
            font-size: 18px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }
        .controls span {
            background: #000;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border: 1px solid #555;
            color: #ff00aa;
            text-shadow: 0 0 6px #ff00aa;
        }
        .info {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #aaa;
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 6px;
        }
        .info kbd {
            background: #222;
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border: 1px solid #555;
            color: #fff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="game-wrapper">
    <canvas id="gameCanvas" width="800" height="800"></canvas>
    <div class="controls">
        <span>SCORE: <span id="scoreDisplay">0</span></span>
        <span>CREDITS: 1</span>
        <span>LIVES: <span id="livesDisplay">3</span></span>
    </div>
    <div class="info">
        <kbd>←</kbd> <kbd>→</kbd> move &nbsp; <kbd>SPACE</kbd> fire &nbsp; <kbd>R</kbd> restart
    </div>
</div>

